    "text": "Spring tides\n\nSpring tides are the largest. See the tide chart for details, and\nthe harbour map for the layout. Raw tags are dropped.\n\n- Check the gauge\n- Log the reading\n- Note the time\n- Report anomalies\n\n1. First step\n2. Second step\n\nThe sea is calm today.\nVisibility is good.",
